{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24855","headline":"赠罗浮易链师 · 杨衡","name":"赠罗浮易链师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海上多仙峤，灵人信长生。\n荣卫冰雪姿，咽嚼日月精。\n默书绦符遍，晦步斗文成。\n翠发披肩长，金盖凌风轻。\n晓籁息尘响，天鸡叱幽声。\n碧树来户阴，丹霞照窗明。\n焚香叩虚寂，稽首回太清。\n鸾鹭振羽仪，飞翻拂斾旌。\n左挹玉泉液，右搴云芝英。\n念得参龙驾，攀天度赤城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}